Scope of this license

The license above covers only the code and documentation written for this
project. It does not cover Fireboy & Watergirl itself: the game, its
characters, art, audio and level designs, and the material in extracted/
(which is derived from the original game), are the property of Oslo Albet and
are not covered by this license. The same applies to the files generated from
the original game's code and data: engine/src/game/game.ts (translated from the
game's decompiled ActionScript) and engine/src/flash/symbols.ts (generated from
the game's SWF library).

engine/src/box2d/box2d.ts is a machine translation of Box2DFlash 2.0.2,
Copyright (c) 2006-2007 Erin Catto. It is distributed under Box2D's own zlib
license, whose notice is in engine/BOX2D-LICENSE.txt, and not under the MIT
license above.

This is an unofficial fan project and is not affiliated with Oslo Albet.
